<title>KENYA: RALLYING-MCRAE WINS SAFARI RALLY.</title>
<headline>RALLYING-MCRAE WINS SAFARI RALLY.</headline>
<dateline>NAIROBI, Kenya 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Briton Colin McRae in a Subaru won the Safari Rally on Monday when he finished seven minutes and four seconds ahead of his nearest challenger, fellow Briton Richard Burns in a Mitsubishi.</p>
</text>
